- Enforce student privacy through Firestore rules independently of frontend filtering.

Student attendance queries must be restricted to the authenticated student's UID.

Create proper Firestore indexes where needed.

Provide complete Firestore Security Rules matching the implemented database structure.

## First admin setup

Provide a secure way to authorize the initial admin Google account.

Admin permissions must be assigned through a trusted setup process, not through an ordinary client-side registration form.

Do not expose admin authorization secrets in the frontend.

